[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=18 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="出航前的检查比你想象中琐碎。拉姆森先让你看舱底的干布，再让你摸绳结，最后问你，如果其中一块布变湿，第一件事该干什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="找漏水的地方？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="先报。你一个人找到的时候，别人也许已经把那一舱当成没问题继续用了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="打捞也一样。看见残骸不代表知道里面装什么；搜索结束前，只能报位置，不能先把它写成“找到补给”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把三张旧照片摆在一起。两张是同一座淹没设施，一张是附近的假信标。你第一次看只觉得都是钢架；第二次才发现影子的方向不一样，拍摄时间和潮位也对不上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果我只看最后那张，可能会把两处当成一处。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="所以先核对原件。今天先去外侧巡查，拿回定位记录，再进主打捞区。不替一张模糊照片赌整队船。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们多走一趟，回程晚一点。仓库那边我去说，你别因为怕耽误别人，就把查不到的事说成查到了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我刚才确实想说，应该差不多。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我也常想。想了不等于必须照着做。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森把干布折成方块递给你，让你自己塞进工具袋最上层。你问为什么不是最下面，她说真要用的时候，你不会想先翻一遍所有螺丝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我帮你看着后面的箱子。不过别指望我替你把它塞好，我塞东西的本事，拉姆森不太承认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="因为你把扳手和饼干放一个袋里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那袋饼干本来就硬。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="检查完，你们在码头确认了两条命令：目标是记录，不是清空整个海区；装不下的东西可以留下，受伤的人必须带回来。纸上没有一句像誓言，读起来反而不容易漏掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

